{"ref":"BDB, עֶ֫בֶד","hw":"עֶ֫בֶד","html":"I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֶ֫בֶד</span></big><sub>799</sub>  <strong>n.m. slave, servant (</strong>on format. Lag<sup>BN 77</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:25\" href=\"/Genesis.9.25\">Gn 9:25</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">עָ֑בֶד</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:10\" href=\"/Genesis.44.10\">44:10</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַבְדִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:24\" href=\"/Genesis.26.24\">26:24</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַבְדְּךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:19\" href=\"/Genesis.19.19\">19:19</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַבְדֶּ֫ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:3\" href=\"/Genesis.18.3\">18:3</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבָדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:25\" href=\"/Genesis.9.25\">9:25</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַבְדֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:25\" href=\"/Genesis.21.25\">21:25</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבָדַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:42\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.42\">Lv 25:42</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַבְדֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:11\" href=\"/Joshua.9.11\">Jos 9:11</a> +, etc.;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>slave, servant</em> of household <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:17\" href=\"/Genesis.39.17\">Gn 39:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:19\" href=\"/Genesis.39.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:12\" href=\"/Genesis.41.12\">41:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:2\" href=\"/Genesis.50.2\">50:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:2\" href=\"/Exodus.21.2\">Ex 21:2</a> +; <em>man-servant</em>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אמה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:10\" href=\"/Exodus.20.10\">Ex 20:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.6\">Lv 25:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 5:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.5.14\">Dt 5:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 31:13\" href=\"/Job.31.13\">Jb 31:13</a> +; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁפחה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:16\" href=\"/Genesis.12.16\">Gn 12:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:6\" href=\"/Genesis.32.6\">32:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jer